	+ The function should be able to handle input arrays of different lengths.
	+ If the input array is empty, the function should return an empty list.
	+ If the input array contains only one element, the function should return a list with one inner list that contains the element.
	+ If the input array contains multiple elements, the function should return a list with multiple inner lists that contain all possible permutations of the elements in the input array.
	+ The function should be able to handle input arrays that contain duplicate elements.

